{"id":"banda","lemma":"банда","pos":"noun","rank":2180,"glosses":["gang"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"банды","plural":"банды"},"examples":[{"text":"Том, похоже, член банды.","en":"Tom seems to be a member of a gang.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"it seems"},{"g":"limb"},null]},{"text":"Банда планировала ограбление.","en":"The gang was planning a robbery.","words":[null,{"g":"to plan","l":"планировать"},{"g":"robbery"}]},{"text":"Том был убит членами своей банды.","en":"Tom was killed by his own gang members.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"limb","l":"член"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Мой прадед был главарём банды.","en":"My great-grandfather was the leader of a gang.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"great-grandfather"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"На этой улице есть банда мальчишек-хулиганов.","en":"There's a gang of tough kids on this street.","words":[{"g":"on / at"},null,null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,null,null]}]}